{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/96cb3dc010b61fbaa14b832aaaca3e4a.avif?t=1765203622\" width=467 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/902e31acda4cbfe114290085e702bf3a.avif?t=1765203622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras_big/902e31acda4cbfe114290085e702bf3a.webp?t=1765203622 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suncraft</strong> is a cozy village crafting adventure set in a charming pixel art world full of life, mystery, and warmth.<br>Take part in rebuilding a quiet land that is waiting to come alive again, a place where every crafted tool, planted seed, and helping hand makes a difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest villager, you will gather, build, and grow alongside friends who each have their own stories to tell.<br>The forests hide old memories, the mountains hold forgotten paths, and the fields slowly return to life as you work together to restore what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace with no timers and no pressure.<br>Settle into the calm rhythm of rebuilding, enjoy the small moments of progress, and watch the village evolve at the speed of your curiosity.<br>Suncraft is about care, creation, and the quiet joy of seeing a world take shape one peaceful task at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Do you want to enjoy the atmosphere of Suncraft?</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>Add to your wishlist now and you'll be notified when we launch!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0a220249b37d5a0adc301e283a82572e.webp?t=1765203622\" width=377 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources across diverse biomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore peaceful forests, molten fields, snowy peaks, and mysterious ruins to collect materials that fuel the village\u2019s growth and unlock new crafting paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0f20d7be10ca1a39701b6f91773f12aa.poster.avif?t=1765203622\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0f20d7be10ca1a39701b6f91773f12aa.webm?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/0f20d7be10ca1a39701b6f91773f12aa.mp4?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tools and rebuild the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process raw materials into useful components, build workstations and machines, and restore broken structures to bring life and function back to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/38a65ae3aa2e3288a078a278214972b7.poster.avif?t=1765203622\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/38a65ae3aa2e3288a078a278214972b7.webm?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/38a65ae3aa2e3288a078a278214972b7.mp4?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your abilities and equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve gathering speed, crafting efficiency, movement, and daily comfort. Earn meaningful upgrades that make every task smoother and more satisfying.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/a48ab82b721b08d91e8382f83d88efef.poster.avif?t=1765203622\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/a48ab82b721b08d91e8382f83d88efef.webm?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/a48ab82b721b08d91e8382f83d88efef.mp4?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete quests and uncover the village\u2019s story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help villagers repair bridges, revive old spaces, and solve gentle puzzles. Meet quirky characters, explore forgotten laboratories and quiet corners, and discover the cozy secrets that shape this land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/7fc947d794205024d798691e069b0d1b.poster.avif?t=1765203622\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/7fc947d794205024d798691e069b0d1b.webm?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/7fc947d794205024d798691e069b0d1b.mp4?t=1765203622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/f1ecd1df6d3025d7d4e7778cb9e6fb4b.webp?t=1765203622\" width=621 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet colorful villagers with their dreams, challenges, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/extras/b9633b12ffcb64b13260b8bdf12ec814.avif?t=1765203622\" width=354 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eric</strong>, the steady workshop master, helps you with tools and repairs.<br><strong>Penny</strong> and <strong>Hank</strong> hope to rebuild the bridge that has long separated their lands.<br><strong>Kael</strong>, a wanderer drawn to volcanic lands, seeks answers.<br><strong>Niko</strong>, a young inventor, chases inventions that often outgrow their workbench.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow the village and your own strengths, you\u2019ll uncover hidden connections, small mysteries, and warmth returning to places that had grown quiet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078110?t=1765203622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/1199845c5d29cebcc76c7de47b7cd635a3823fc6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765203622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/c0101a581b26b76c55acaf0435b936ef88b6f617/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765203622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078110/c0101a581b26b76c55acaf0435b936ef88b6f617/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765203622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descript